  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Bellou Toilettage has been based at La Serinette, in Toulon, since 1998 according to its official website. Alexandra, a qualified dog groomer with over twenty years of experience, receives clients at 23 place Adolphe Béguin, in an air-conditioned, secure salon entirely dedicated to dogs. Rabbits and guinea pigs are also welcome. The business is registered under SIRET 488 003 823 00017 (NAF activity 9609, other personal services).</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is visited by appointment only: the official website invites you to call for advice, a price or a date, on 06 77 49 49 58, or on the landline 04 94 36 11 52. No price list is published online and opening days are not shown on the website. Professional directories (PagesJaunes, Mappy) detail the services offered: bath, scissor cut, hand-stripping, nail clipping and massage for dogs, with breeds cited such as Yorkshire terrier, poodle, cocker, schnauzer, dachshund, Labrador, golden retriever or Bernese mountain dog. Payment is by cheque or cash, and the salon also sells collars, toys and grooming accessories.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: give your dog's breed, size and temperament as soon as you call, especially if it fears the hairdryer or noise: this lets them estimate the duration and price before the appointment.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Place Adolphe Béguin is in the La Serinette district of Toulon. A customer quoted on PagesJaunes brought two of their dogs there and says they appreciated Alexandra's welcome.</p>
    </div>

